{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46765","headline":"题赠湘西龙安寺利禅师 · 齐己","name":"题赠湘西龙安寺利禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"头白已无行脚念，自开荒寺住烟萝。\n门前路到潇湘尽，石上云归岳麓多。\n南祖衣盂曾礼谒，东林泉月旧经过。\n闲来松外看城郭，一片红尘隔逝波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}